==Introduction==

===Abstract===

This document defines new Partially Signed Bitcoin Transaction ([[bip-0174.mediawiki|BIP 174]]) field types for carrying SPHINCS+ public keys, SPHINCS+ signatures, and Taproot annex data. These fields extend the Taproot PSBT support defined in [[bip-0371.mediawiki|BIP 371]] to enable hardware wallet and multi-party signing workflows for transactions using [[bip-0368.mediawiki|BIP 368]] (key-path hardening) and [[bip-0369.mediawiki|BIP 369]] (<code>OP_CHECKSPHINCSVERIFY</code>).

The fields defined in this BIP are a '''data transport layer'''. They carry SPHINCS+ key material, signatures, and annex data through the PSBT pipeline without enforcing consensus rules. Annex format validation and witness construction rules are defined in [[bip-0368.mediawiki|BIP 368]] and [[bip-0369.mediawiki|BIP 369]]; final transaction validity is enforced by consensus. This BIP specifies PSBT field types and serialization only; it does not define RPC methods, wallet APIs, or transaction construction workflows.

